# Delivery Baseline

- Every implementation must be complete end-to-end. No half-done delivery is allowed.
- A change is incomplete if any core link is missing, such as route only, pseudo handler, repository stub, missing integration path, missing tests, or missing docs.
- During execution, continuously read the latest code in touched areas and actively detect partial/pseudo logic.
- Once a finding is detected, do two actions immediately:
  - report it in the work update
  - append it to `docs/migration/realtime-findings-log.md`
- After the current phase, run a dedicated convergence pass to close logged findings one by one.
